{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.yuika.shop",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她说要带我去挑眼镜",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.yuika.shop",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.yuika.shop",
    "idolId": "yuika",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（哦……！现在的女孩子都在这种地方买东西吗……！）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "当然！……重新看一遍，还是好厉害呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……果然请你带路是对的。一个人来，我可能就有点缩了。",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "偶尔也得孝敬一下制作人嘛。这也算偶像的职责？",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "……不过，『想学习最近的时尚』，制作人还真是认真啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是工作需要的。我对流行也不算了解，得好好看看。",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "哦哦，很有制作人的发言！不愧是！那赶紧走吧！",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "从哪儿开始逛好呢……？",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "不用想那么复杂也没关系，总之，随心所欲！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这里是杂货店啊……哦，还卖眼镜。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "结华的话，实用也是需要的，但从时尚的角度看也很重要吧……？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "哦！制作人眼光不错嘛～！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "眼镜换一副，印象会变很多，所以很重要哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "毕竟，三峰要是换了副眼镜，不就完全变个人了？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "原来如此……？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "啊。制作人完全没 get 到吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "来啦来啦，看好了——",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "当当～！怎么样？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦……挺合适的。这个镜框，猫的形状……吧？嗯，不错。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "对对！很有趣吧～？戴上这个，就能带着两只猫走路了！",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "而且，这个和平时那副，感觉看起来不一样吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是啊，确实挺少见。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "您能明白就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "左右颜色不同，也是重点吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "理解得真快呢Ｐくん，很好～答案是 YES！可爱吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "哦？制作人也喜欢这个？要不要戴戴看？",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我、我就不用了。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "哎呀呀，真遗憾。我还以为能凑成一对呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "……啊，那那边的眼镜呢？看起来挺适合你的吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，等等，结华……！",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "哈——好开心！和制作人一起逛店，可不常有！",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "结华也开心就好。陪我逛，帮大忙了。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今天没逛完，不过也有收获……时尚真是深奥啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "噗……啊哈哈！制作人，太认真了！",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是吗？……总之，下次还得来学。你有空的话，还想请你陪我。",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "好好好，ｏｋ。三峰也觉得挺有意思的。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "……啊，对了。那就布置个作业，到下次来之前。",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "yuika",
        "text": "三峰觉得最适合的眼镜是哪副，制作人你自己想想看！",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……结果一路上都是她在带我。回去的路上，她一直在说镜框的事。）"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
  "createdAt": "2026-11-02T01:10:00.000Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T01:10:00.000Z",
